width=\"163\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">14:00-19:00</p> </td>\n   <td style=\"border-bottom: solid 1pt; width: 197.35pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-right: solid 1pt; height: 62.9pt;\" width=\"263\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">康公廟前地</p> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr style=\"height: 62.9pt;\">\n   <td style=\"border: solid 1pt; width: 106.6pt; border-top: none; height: 62.9pt;\" width=\"142\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">9月26日</p> </td>\n   <td style=\"border-bottom: solid 1pt; width: 122.5pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-right: solid 1pt; height: 62.9pt;\" width=\"163\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">14:00-19:00</p> </td>\n   <td style=\"border-bottom: solid 1pt; width: 197.35pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-right: solid 1pt; height: 62.9pt;\" width=\"263\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">黑沙環公園</p> </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr style=\"height: 62.9pt;\">\n   <td style=\"border: solid 1pt; width: 106.6pt; border-top: none; height: 62.9pt;\" width=\"142\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">9月27日</p> </td>\n   <td style=\"border-bottom: solid 1pt; width: 122.5pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-right: solid 1pt; height: 62.9pt;\" width=\"163\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">14:00-19:00</p> </td>\n   <td style=\"border-bottom: solid 1pt; width: 197.35pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-right: solid 1pt; height: 62.9pt;\" width=\"263\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">氹仔花城公園側之空地</p> <p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">（近哥英布拉街）</p> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
